sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as order-service
    participant S as PaymentService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant PSP as Provider
    O->>S: authorize(order 7, 179.80, tok)
    S->>DB: tx 1: lock payment by order — none → INSERT AUTHORIZING
    S->>PSP: authorize(key = order 7) [deadline 1.5 s]
    alt approved
        PSP-->>S: Approved(ref)
        S->>DB: tx 2: AUTHORIZED + attempt (void first if a void was requested meanwhile)
        S-->>O: 200 AUTHORIZED
    else declined
        PSP-->>S: Declined
        S->>DB: tx 2: DECLINED + attempt + PaymentFailed
        S-->>O: 402 PAYMENT_DECLINED
    else no answer in time
        S->>DB: tx 2: UNKNOWN + attempt
        S-->>O: 504 PAYMENT_UNKNOWN
    end
